{"calibration_results":[{"calibration_case_id":"calibration:complete-frame-mismatch","evidence_basis":"stated_evidence_only","invented_material_premise":false,"rationale":"The target requires all 100 planned locations, but the only selected result uses 73 screened locations and presents that conditional denominator as the planned-region rate. The stated absence of an amendment or approved deviation defeats the available falsification that the target scope was validly changed.","verdict":"demonstrated_issue"},{"calibration_case_id":"calibration:conditional-subset-scope","evidence_basis":"stated_evidence_only","invented_material_premise":false,"rationale":"The registered target, selected denominator, and reported claim all refer to the same 73 signal-eligible locations. Attempting to falsify that alignment by identifying a full-frame claim fails because every claim is expressly limited to signal-eligible locations.","verdict":"no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope"},{"calibration_case_id":"calibration:full-frame-accounting","evidence_basis":"stated_evidence_only","invented_material_premise":false,"rationale":"The result preserves all 100 planned locations in the denominator, documents the 27 unavailable measurements, and reports the full-frame rate. Attempting to establish screened-case denominator substitution fails because no planned location is removed from the denominator.","verdict":"no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope"},{"calibration_case_id":"calibration:unrelated-quality-endpoint","evidence_basis":"stated_evidence_only","invented_material_premise":false,"rationale":"The scientific result uses all 100 planned locations. The 73-record pass fraction belongs to a separate quality-control table explicitly excluded from the scientific endpoint, so attempting to infer scientific denominator restriction from that table fails on the stated endpoint separation.","verdict":"no_demonstrated_issue_within_scope"},{"calibration_case_id":"calibration:conflicting-scope-records","evidence_basis":"stated_evidence_only","invented_material_premise":false,"rationale":"The eligible-location result agrees with one signed plan but conflicts with the other equally authoritative signed plan, and neither plan has precedence. Attempting to resolve the scope from authority or precedence fails under the stated evidence, leaving the governing target materially unknown.","verdict":"conditional_or_unknown"},{"calibration_case_id":"calibration:no-selected-result","evidence_basis":"stated_evidence_only","invented_material_premise":false,"rationale":"The repository can emit multiple runtime-selected reports, but the preserved record identifies neither a selected report nor whether any report supported the scientific claim. A mismatch cannot be falsified or demonstrated without knowing the selected scientific result, so the evidence is insufficient.","verdict":"insufficient_evidence"}],"reviewer_participant_id":"actor:stage1-recovery-codex-01"}